    "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
    "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-bffe03609f@example.invalid",
    "text": "<p>Thank you to our employees for making Stryker one of Glassdoor’s Best Places to Work! We have been named #76 out of the 100 Best Places to Work on Glassdoor in 2018. The list was compiled based on our feedback from our employees on Glassdoor.</p>\n<p>We are proud to be included on this year’s list.</p>\n<p>Click <a href=\"https://www.glassdoor.com/Award/Best-Places-to-Work-LST_KQ0,19.htm\">here</a> to see the full list.&nbsp;</p>\n",
